# Deploy

Site publish is `pnpm ship` (Wrangler Worker `model-facts`, uploads `site/` as static assets with no build step). This is a Worker, not a Pages project. Do not use `wrangler pages deploy`. Run `pnpm sync` in `directory-tools/` first if the catalog changed.
